      "type": "text",
      "html": "<h2 data-section-id=\"1t1vzxd\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"486\">Module 1: Understanding The TKEA Reseller System</h2><p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"520\">What exactly is a TKEA Reseller?</p><p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"576\">How digital reselling works in today\u2019s online economy.</p><p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"625\">Understanding the modern reseller model behind:</p><ul data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"690\"><li data-section-id=\"ljoyui\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"644\">Digital products</li><li data-section-id=\"bs0vvn\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"664\">Affiliate systems</li><li data-section-id=\"w7nvxw\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"690\">Attention-based selling</li></ul><p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"782\">Why smart online entrepreneurs leverage existing systems instead of starting from scratch.</p><hr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"vz29sa\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"834\">Module 2: Sales Funnels &amp; Buyer Psychology</h2><p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"870\">From Attention \u2192 Interest \u2192 Sales.</p><p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"931\">Understanding how strangers become paying customers online.</p><p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"973\">Why people actually buy products online.</p><p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1006\">Learning the psychology behind:</p><ul data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1056\"><li data-section-id=\"177ppng\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1014\">Trust</li><li data-section-id=\"q1km59\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1026\">Curiosity</li><li data-section-id=\"1udutyc\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1035\">Desire</li><li data-section-id=\"12vhwy1\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1056\">Digital persuasion</li></ul><p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1105\">How simple funnels turn views into commissions.</p><hr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1f3fkvg\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1151\">Module 3: Market Research Like A Pro</h2><p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1226\">Using AI, Google Trends, and Google Keywords to understand online demand.</p><p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1244\">How to discover:</p><ul data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1333\"><li data-section-id=\"103ix15\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1269\">What people are buying</li><li data-section-id=\"avw39b\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1296\">What skills are trending</li><li data-section-id=\"1m4cbtm\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1333\">What products are easier to market</li></ul><p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1357\">Learn how to identify:</p><ul data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1426\"><li data-section-id=\"1j8938l\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1378\">The right audience</li><li data-section-id=\"cpsjei\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1398\">The right product</li><li data-section-id=\"o6kwlw\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1426\">The right marketing angle</li></ul><p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1466\">Stop guessing. Start following demand.</p><hr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1471\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1bixgxd\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1525\">Module 4: Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram) Advertising</h2><p data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1572\">Step-by-step Meta Ads training for beginners.</p><p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1622\">How to launch Facebook &amp; Instagram ads properly.</p><p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1638\">Understanding:</p><ul data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1721\"><li data-section-id=\"161v3uu\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1668\">Meta Andromeda optimisation</li><li data-section-id=\"pvjdd9\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1689\">Audience targeting</li><li data-section-id=\"sqmyq9\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1706\">Campaign setup</li><li data-section-id=\"bbvhw8\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1721\">Ad structure</li></ul><p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1820\">How to connect your Meta Pixel to your TKEA reseller account for better tracking and conversions.</p><hr data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1825\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1pdfl15\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1865\">Module 5: TikTok Advertising System</h2><p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1908\">How to run TikTok Ads even as a beginner.</p><p data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1969\">Understanding TikTok audience behavior and viral attention.</p><p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1978\">How to:</p><ul data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2068\"><li data-section-id=\"tegkm1\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2007\">Target audiences on TikTok</li><li data-section-id=\"1knam6o\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2032\">Structure ad creatives</li><li data-section-id=\"qk9jj1\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2068\">Optimise for engagement and sales</li></ul><p data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2133\">How to connect your TikTok Pixel to your TKEA reseller account.</p><hr data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2138\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"ttlp9u\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2171\">Module 6: The Art Of Selling</h2><p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2243\">Why some people struggle to sell while others make sales consistently.</p><p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2259\">Understanding:</p><ul data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2351\"><li data-section-id=\"tfmd61\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2279\">Offer positioning</li><li data-section-id=\"12vhwy1\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2300\">Digital persuasion</li><li data-section-id=\"d25396\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2322\">Attention marketing</li><li data-section-id=\"1yb7awz\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2351\">Emotional selling triggers</li></ul><p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2414\">How to communicate value without sounding pushy or desperate.</p><p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2461\">Learn how modern online selling really works.</p><hr data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2466\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"vx1y8e\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2507\">Module 7: Mastering Content Creation</h2><p data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2582\">How to create simple content that attracts attention and drives interest.</p><p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2593\">Learning:</p><ul data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2695\"><li data-section-id=\"1l3vcib\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2623\">Short-form content strategy</li><li data-section-id=\"1p0e4v8\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2651\">Hooks that stop scrolling</li><li data-section-id=\"l28dxv\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2695\">Content that converts viewers into buyers</li></ul><p data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2723\">How to create content for:</p><ul data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2782\"><li data-section-id=\"5miwry\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2732\">TikTok</li><li data-section-id=\"6htwxs\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2743\">Facebook</li><li data-section-id=\"1oeo77h\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2761\">Instagram Reels</li><li data-section-id=\"s2911w\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2782\">WhatsApp marketing</li></ul><p data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2810\">No expensive setup needed.</p><hr data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2815\" /><h1 data-section-id=\"15ay5fa\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2838\">\u00a0</h1>"
